  "bodyHash": "qn+djBNiJt0=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的多款活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>隨機潛影貝顏色是一款可配置的伺服器端模組，能讓世界中每次新生成的潛影貝擁有隨機顏色。它們不再只有紫珀色的外殼，而是會呈現 16 種顏色中的一種。它們也有機會以不帶顏色的普通變體生成。你可以配置所使用的顏色清單，例如若你只想讓它們變成紅色，那也是可行的。<br><br>掉落物潛影貝外殼仍然是預設的樣式。這可以防止你的物品欄在終界農場時被塞滿，也代表不會新增任何自訂物品。<br><br><strong>注意：</strong>任何配置變更都需要重新啟動才能生效。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的額外套裝\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>possibleShulkerColours</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 \"normal,black,blue,brown,cyan,gray,green,light_blue,light_gray,lime,magenta,orange,pink,purple,red,white,yellow\"<br>模組會從中選擇的潛影貝顏色，以逗號分隔。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/random-shulker-colours/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p>使用生怪蛋放置的潛影貝，每個都隨機分配了一種顏色：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/random-shulker-colours/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，前提是下載連結仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或任何其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
